# Workshop Environmental Monitor — git ignore
#
# IMPORTANT: this file must be named EXACTLY ".gitignore" (leading dot, no
# other extension) at the repo root. Git will silently ignore a file named
# anything else, including "gitignore" with no dot — that filename has no
# special meaning to git at all.

###############################################################################
# WEM-specific — credentials & documents
###############################################################################
# Real credentials — never commit. Share secrets.h.example instead.
secrets.h
# Safety net: catch any stray/backup copies too.
secrets.*.h
secrets.h.bak
*.secrets.h
RELEASE_PROCEDURE.md

###############################################################################
# WEM-specific — Arduino / Visual Micro build artefacts
###############################################################################
/build/
/.vs/
/Debug/
/Release/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map

###############################################################################
# WEM-specific — OS cruft
###############################################################################
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

###############################################################################
# Visual Studio boilerplate (VisualStudio.gitignore, trimmed set relevant to
# a Visual Micro / Arduino sketch project — see
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore for
# the full upstream list if this project ever grows a .NET/C# component)
###############################################################################

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Macro folder
__vm/

# Visual Studio cache/options directory
.vs/

# Files built by Visual Studio / compiler intermediates
*_i.c
*_p.c
*_h.h
*.ilk
*.meta
*.obj
*.iobj
*.pch
*.pdb
*.ipdb
*.pgc
